    <string name="about_title">About AppsPerms</string>
    <string name="about_body">AppsPerms — a lightweight AppOps manager focused on SYSTEM_ALERT_WINDOW (Display over other apps) plus 18 related ops (camera, microphone, clipboard, location, and more).\n\nBuilt in XyVerse (@xykalnotkel)\n\nHow it works: reads and writes directly through Shizuku without permanent root. Super responsive, 100% transparent, no ads, and no internet permission (data can never leave the device).</string>
